{"seq":3,"at":"2026-11-21T13:55:06.572Z","layer":"qed-math","why":"Add demo levels for inductive declarations written from natural-language requirements","by":"cli","ops":[{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"Parent","value":{"zh":"{0}是{1}的父母","en":"{0} is a parent of {1}"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"Anc","value":{"zh":"{0}是{1}的祖先","en":"{0} is an ancestor of {1}"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"Flight","value":{"zh":"{0}有直飞{1}的航班","en":"{0} has a direct flight to {1}"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"Reach","value":{"zh":"从{0}能到{1}","en":"{1} can be reached from {0}"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"i","value":{"zh":"安","en":"Ann"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"j","value":{"zh":"博","en":"Bo"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"k","value":{"zh":"茜","en":"Cy"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"l","value":{"zh":"丹","en":"Dan"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"m","value":{"zh":"成都","en":"Chengdu"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"n","value":{"zh":"武汉","en":"Wuhan"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"o","value":{"zh":"上海","en":"Shanghai"}},{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"p","value":{"zh":"广州","en":"Guangzhou"}},{"op":"level.add","level":"demo-anc","data":{"title":{"zh":"演示 · 声明祖先","en":"Demo · Declare ancestor"},"intro":[{"t":{"zh":"「并且」「或者」的声明里，前提都是别的句子。这一关要声明的句子说的是两个人之间的关系，它的前提里还可以出现它自己。","en":"The premises in the declarations of “and” and “or” were other sentences. The sentence declared here relates two people, and it may appear among its own premises."}},{"t":{"zh":"规则板第一行是要声明的那句话，其中 x、y 任取。每个可推导情形还可以再任取一个 z。","en":"The first row of the rule board is the sentence being declared, for any x and y. Each derivable situation may also take any z."}}],"after":{"zh":"前提里出现了正在声明的那句话，这样的声明叫归纳声明。它说的仍是「只有这几条来路」：从族谱上的父母关系出发，一轮一轮使用这两条规则，造得出的才算祖先，所以兄弟姐妹不算。规则表下面的消去规则多了一个前提 ?R(z, y)，它就是归纳假设，来自前提「z是y的祖先」。Lean 把这份声明写作 inductive，每个可推导情形是一个构造子。","en":"A declaration whose own sentence appears among its premises is an inductive declaration. It still says “only these ways”: starting from the parents on record, only what these two rules build round after round counts as an ancestor, so siblings do not. The elimination rule under the table has one more premise, ?R(z, y): the induction hypothesis, which comes from the premise “z is an ancestor of y”. Lean writes this declaration as an inductive, with one constructor for each derivable situation."},"declare":{"zh":"祖先","en":"ancestor"},"words":["everyday"],"target":"Anc(x, y)","params":["x","y"],"sentences":["Parent(x, z)","Anc(z, y)"],"things":["i","j","k","l"],"thing":true,"binder":"z","tests":[{"given":["Parent(i, j)"],"goal":"Anc(i, j)","make":true},{"given":["Parent(i, j)","Parent(j, k)"],"goal":"Anc(i, k)","make":true},{"given":["Parent(i, j)","Parent(j, k)","Parent(k, l)"],"goal":"Anc(i, l)","make":true},{"given":["Parent(i, j)"],"goal":"Anc(j, i)","make":false},{"given":["Parent(i, j)","Parent(i, k)"],"goal":"Anc(j, k)","make":false},{"given":["Parent(i, k)","Parent(j, k)"],"goal":"Anc(i, j)","make":false},{"given":[],"goal":"Anc(i, i)","make":false}],"solution":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Parent(x, y)"]},{"binds":["z"],"needs":["Parent(x, z)","Anc(z, y)"]}],"naive":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Parent(x, y)"]}],"tasks":[{"id":"demo-anc-write","kind":"logic/iso","step":{"zh":"写声明","en":"Write the declaration"},"brief":{"zh":"需求：族谱只记了谁是谁的父母。祖先指一个人的父母、父母的父母，一直往上，隔多少代都算；其他人都不算。写出「x是y的祖先」的声明。","en":"Requirement: the family record only says who is a parent of whom. A person’s ancestors are their parents, their parents’ parents, and so on upward through any number of generations; nobody else counts. Write the declaration of “x is an ancestor of y”."},"hint":[{"zh":"需求里有两种来路：只隔一代的，和隔更多代的。","en":"The requirement gives two ways: one generation apart, and more than one."},{"zh":"隔更多代时，中间总有一个人 z：x 是 z 的父母，而 z 已经是 y 的祖先。","en":"With more generations between them there is always someone z in the middle: x is a parent of z, and z is already an ancestor of y."}]},{"id":"demo-anc-weak","kind":"logic/iso","play":"logic/audit","want":"logic/expose","step":{"zh":"只认两代","en":"Two generations only"},"intro":[{"t":{"zh":"有人把需求译成：父母是祖先，祖父母也是祖先。","en":"Someone translated the requirement as: parents are ancestors, and so are grandparents."}}],"brief":{"zh":"写一条检验条例，暴露这份声明的错误：按需求结论可推导，这份声明却推导不出。","en":"Write one test case that exposes this declaration: the conclusion is derivable by the requirement, but this declaration cannot derive it."},"hint":[{"zh":"需求说「隔多少代都算」。","en":"The requirement says “through any number of generations”."}],"boards":[{"rules":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Parent(x, y)"]},{"binds":["z"],"needs":["Parent(x, z)","Parent(z, y)"]}]}],"slots":[{"make":true,"fixed":["make"]}],"answer":[{"given":["Parent(i, j)","Parent(j, k)","Parent(k, l)"],"goal":"Anc(i, l)","make":true}],"naive":[{"given":["Parent(i, j)","Parent(j, k)"],"goal":"Anc(i, k)","make":true}]},{"id":"demo-anc-strong","kind":"logic/iso","play":"logic/audit","want":"logic/expose","step":{"zh":"认错了人","en":"The wrong people"},"intro":[{"t":{"zh":"另一份声明把第二种来路写成：z 是 x 的父母，并且 z 是 y 的祖先。","en":"Another declaration writes the second way as: z is a parent of x, and z is an ancestor of y."}}],"brief":{"zh":"写一条检验条例，暴露这份声明的错误：按需求结论不可推导，这份声明却推导出了它。","en":"Write one test case that exposes this declaration: the conclusion is not derivable by the requirement, but this declaration derives it."},"hint":[{"zh":"试试同一个人的两个孩子。","en":"Try two children of the same person."}],"boards":[{"rules":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Parent(x, y)"]},{"binds":["z"],"needs":["Parent(z, x)","Anc(z, y)"]}]}],"slots":[{"make":false,"fixed":["make"]}],"answer":[{"given":["Parent(i, j)","Parent(i, k)"],"goal":"Anc(j, k)","make":false}],"naive":[{"given":["Parent(i, j)"],"goal":"Anc(j, i)","make":false}]}]}},{"op":"level.add","level":"demo-reach","data":{"title":{"zh":"演示 · 声明能到达","en":"Demo · Declare reachable"},"intro":[{"t":{"zh":"同一种声明，换一份需求。这一次没有提示告诉你有几种来路。","en":"The same kind of declaration for another requirement. This time no hint says how many ways there are."}}],"after":{"zh":"需求里的「转几次都行」译成了一条提到自己的规则；「航班是单向的」不用写：声明只说哪些造得出，没写的来路都不算。","en":"“With any number of connections” became a rule that mentions itself. “Flights go one way” needs no rule: a declaration only says what can be built, and nothing else counts."},"tasks":[{"id":"demo-reach","kind":"logic/iso","declare":{"zh":"能到达","en":"reachable"},"words":["everyday"],"target":"Reach(x, y)","params":["x","y"],"sentences":["Flight(x, z)","Reach(z, y)"],"things":["m","n","o","p"],"thing":true,"binder":"z","brief":{"zh":"需求：航班表只列出直飞航班。旅客想知道从一座城市能不能到另一座：直飞能到，转机也算，转几次都行。航班是单向的，没有返程航班就回不来。写出「从x能到y」的声明。","en":"Requirement: the timetable lists direct flights only. A traveller wants to know whether one city can be reached from another: a direct flight counts, and so does any number of connections. Flights go one way; without a return flight there is no way back. Write the declaration of “y can be reached from x”."},"hint":[{"zh":"转机时，先直飞到某座城市 z。","en":"With a connection, first fly direct to some city z."}],"tests":[{"given":["Flight(m, n)"],"goal":"Reach(m, n)","make":true},{"given":["Flight(m, n)","Flight(n, o)"],"goal":"Reach(m, o)","make":true},{"given":["Flight(m, n)","Flight(n, o)","Flight(o, p)"],"goal":"Reach(m, p)","make":true},{"given":["Flight(m, n)"],"goal":"Reach(n, m)","make":false},{"given":["Flight(m, n)","Flight(o, p)"],"goal":"Reach(m, p)","make":false},{"given":["Flight(m, n)","Flight(m, o)"],"goal":"Reach(n, o)","make":false}],"solution":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Flight(x, y)"]},{"binds":["z"],"needs":["Flight(x, z)","Reach(z, y)"]}],"naive":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Flight(x, y)"]},{"binds":["z"],"needs":["Flight(x, z)","Flight(z, y)"]}]}]}},{"op":"level.add","level":"demo-nat","data":{"title":{"zh":"演示 · 声明自然数","en":"Demo · Declare the natural numbers"},"intro":[{"t":{"zh":"这一次声明的是一种东西。需求只说它用来做什么，造法要自己找出来。","en":"This time the declaration is of a kind of thing. The requirement only says what it is for; finding the ways to build it is up to you."}}],"after":{"zh":"第二种来路的前提正是「自然数」自己，所以生成的消去规则在这一种情况里多给一个 ?R：对手上那个数已经得到的结果。它就是归纳假设。","en":"The premise of the second way is “natural number” itself, so the generated elimination rule gives one more ?R in that case: the result already obtained for the number in hand. That is the induction hypothesis."},"tasks":[{"id":"demo-nat","kind":"logic/iso","declare":{"zh":"自然数","en":"natural number"},"words":["everyday","terms"],"target":"Nat","params":[],"sentences":["Nat"],"brief":{"zh":"需求：要一种用来数数的东西。一个都还没数，也是一个数；每多数一个，就从手上的数得到下一个数；除了这样数出来的，没有别的数。写出自然数的声明。","en":"Requirement: something to count with. Having counted nothing is already a number; counting one more gives the next number from the one in hand; there are no numbers other than those counted this way. Write the declaration of the natural numbers."},"hint":[{"zh":"需求里有两种得到数的办法。","en":"The requirement gives two ways to get a number."},{"zh":"第二种办法先要手上有一个数。","en":"The second way needs a number in hand first."}],"ways":[[],["Nat"]],"tests":[{"given":[],"make":true}],"solution":[{"binds":[],"needs":[]},{"binds":[],"needs":["Nat"]}],"naive":[{"binds":[],"needs":["Nat"]}]}]}}],"files":[{"file":"packages/qed-math/levels/demo-anc.json","after":"dbc2c97472b559c8"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/levels/demo-reach.json","after":"fe8a0d1a7a3b7f00"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/levels/demo-nat.json","after":"c029610cfc009cd8"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/wordset/everyday.json","after":"e9bc5ef8c69443da"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/i18n/en.json","after":"34cbda5789c95c85"},{"file":"packages/qed-