{"seq":5,"at":"2026-11-21T14:47:17.675Z","layer":"qed-math","why":"Add a trial level that uses the induction rule of a declared relation as a backward card","by":"cli","ops":[{"op":"object.set","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","path":"Older","value":{"zh":"{0}比{1}年长","en":"{0} is older than {1}"}},{"op":"level.add","level":"try-anc-induct","data":{"title":{"zh":"试用 · 逆用归纳规则","en":"Trial · Induction as a backward card"},"intro":[{"t":{"zh":"声明「祖先」时，规则板下面生成了一条消去规则。它在这里是一张逆用卡：目标说的是所有祖先关系时，倒着用它，目标就分成声明的两种来路，第二种来路的已知里多一条归纳假设。","en":"Declaring “ancestor” generated an elimination rule under the rule board. Here it is a backward card: used on a goal about every ancestor relation, it splits the goal into the two ways of the declaration, and the second way has one more given, the induction hypothesis."}}],"after":{"zh":"搜索只能证明具体的人之间的祖先关系。归纳规则证明的是对所有祖先关系都成立的结论：只有两种来路，两种来路里结论都成立，就没有例外。","en":"Search only proves ancestor relations between particular people. The induction rule proves a conclusion about every ancestor relation: there are only two ways, the conclusion holds in both, so there is no exception."},"tasks":[{"id":"try-anc-induct","kind":"logic/machine","want":"logic/proved","words":["everyday"],"rules":{"ancInduct":{"name":{"zh":"祖先的归纳","en":"Induction on ancestor"},"premises":["⋀x y. ⟦Parent(x, y)⟧ ⟹ ?R(x, y)","⋀x y z. ⟦Parent(x, z); Anc(z, y); ?R(z, y)⟧ ⟹ ?R(x, y)"],"conclusion":"∀x. ∀y. Anc(x, y) → ?R(x, y)"},"parentOlder":{"name":{"zh":"父母年长","en":"Parents are older"},"premises":["Parent(?x, ?y)"],"conclusion":"Older(?x, ?y)"},"olderTrans":{"name":{"zh":"年长可以传递","en":"Older is transitive"},"premises":["Older(?x, ?y)","Older(?y, ?z)"],"conclusion":"Older(?x, ?z)"}},"brief":{"zh":"设计一个证明器，证明：祖先都比后代年长。","en":"Design a prover that proves: every ancestor is older than their descendant."},"hint":[{"zh":"先逆用「祖先的归纳」，目标分成两个。","en":"Start with “Induction on ancestor” used backward; the goal splits in two."},{"zh":"第二个目标的已知里有归纳假设：中间那个人比后代年长。","en":"The second goal has the induction hypothesis among its givens: the person in the middle is older than the descendant."}],"tests":[{"goal":"∀x. ∀y. Anc(x, y) → Older(x, y)"}],"solution":["c0 = logic/directBackward-ancInduct(in)","c1 = logic/directBackward-parentOlder(c0)","c2 = logic/directBackward-logic_assumption(c1)","c3 = logic/directBackward-olderTrans(c2)","c4 = logic/directBackward-parentOlder(c3)","c5 = logic/directBackward-logic_assumption(c4)","out <- c5"]}],"tray":"prover"}}],"files":[{"file":"packages/qed-math/levels/try-anc-induct.json","after":"29de32ceeaec1608"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/wordset/everyday.json","after":"0de84a012a5c97db"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/i18n/en.json","after":"93b1994ca18e88af"},{"file":"packages/qed-math/i18n/zh.json","after":"5a65e3a4e3c1cb9b"}],"inverse":[{"op":"level.remove","level":"try-anc-induct"},{"op":"object.put","kind":"qed-math/wordset","name":"everyday","data":{"Nat":{"en":"a number","zh":"自然数","$key":"course.wordSets.everyday.Nat"},"List":{"en":"a list","zh":"列表","$key":"course.wordSets.everyday.List"},"Bool":{"en":"a truth value","zh":"真假值","$key":"course.wordSets.everyday.Bool"},"s":"{0}+1","zero":"0","Parent":{"en":"{0} is a parent of {1}","zh":"{0}是{1}的父母","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.Parent"},"Anc":{"en":"{0} is an ancestor of {1}","zh":"{0}是{1}的祖先","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.Anc"},"Flight":{"en":"{0} has a direct flight to {1}","zh":"{0}有直飞{1}的航班","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.Flight"},"Reach":{"en":"{1} can be reached from {0}","zh":"从{0}能到{1}","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.Reach"},"i":{"en":"Ann","zh":"安","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.i"},"j":{"en":"Bo","zh":"博","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.j"},"k":{"en":"Cy","zh":"茜","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.k"},"l":{"en":"Dan","zh":"丹","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.l"},"m":{"en":"Chengdu","zh":"成都","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.m"},"n":{"en":"Wuhan","zh":"武汉","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.n"},"o":{"en":"Shanghai","zh":"上海","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.o"},"p":{"en":"Guangzhou","zh":"广州","$key":"qed-math/wordset.everyday.p"}}}]}
